  "description": "Reusable platform-subscription billing and entitlement for multi-tenant ASP.NET Core SaaS. Two orthogonal entitlement axes — plan rank (IsAtLeast) and licensed module set (HasModule) — both enforced as ASP.NET authorization policies that run under FastEndpoints, minimal APIs and MVC, and both denying a lapsed subscription. Entitlement resolves up the tenant tree to the nearest paying ancestor and is never read from the JWT. Includes seat limits with rowversion concurrency, exclusive seat tiers, a downgrade guard, an endpoint entitlement sweep, a Stripe Subscriptions wrapper and an HMAC-verified webhook handler. A second product gets billing in ~30 lines of Program.cs.",
